    {
      "component_id": "c_008",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "FaxReceive allows you to receive a fax with just your phone or tablet. WHEN YOU ARE READY to receive a fax you purchase fax time on our servers. Fax Time starts when purchased. Purchase the amount of fax time you want and FaxReceive will exclusively allocate a number to you for the duration of time you purchase. Provide that fax number to your sender and when they send you a fax it will be delivered to your Android Device. You can save your fax, print it or send it to another app. All fax numbers are US based and require a +1 dialing code when accessed from outside the US. Fax time starts immediately upon purchase and is not refundable but is extendable.",
